/dwelle","html_url":"https://github.com/dwelle","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dwelle/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dwelle/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dwelle/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dwelle/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dwelle/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dwelle/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dwelle/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dwelle/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dwelle/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"jobs_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/excalidraw/excalidraw/actions/runs/35399195567/jobs","logs_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/excalidraw/excalidraw/actions/runs/35399195567/logs","check_suite_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/excalidraw/excalidraw/check-suites/95873136612","artifacts_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/excalidraw/excalidraw/actions/runs/35399195567/artifacts","cancel_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/excalidraw/excalidraw/actions/runs/35399195567/cancel","rerun_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/excalidraw/excalidraw/actions/runs/35399195567/rerun","previous_attempt_url":null,"workflow_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/excalidraw/excalidraw/actions/workflows/64850896","head_commit":{"id":"369ab335f35dbc4d9b2ca06e55e25def13ad2ece","tree_id":"c23c1ed064d70bdc6c1f06b3dcd360f51780ba98","message":"feat(packages/excalidraw): make `onDuplicate` changes stick, support veto & lookups\n\nThe editor kept working with the duplicates it created after calling\n`props.onDuplicate`, so a host returning new objects for them detached\nthem from the frame assignment and bound text redraw on paste, and from\nthe alt-drag handover.\n\n- Add `reconcileDuplicatedElements()` and use it in all three duplication\n  paths (paste/library insert, duplicate action, alt-drag). Elements the\n  host returns for duplicates are shallow-merged into the editor's own\n  objects (omitted properties are kept), invalidating what may have been\n  cached for them by then (shape, bounds). Other returned elements keep\n  the replace semantics.\n- Omitting a duplicate (or returning it as deleted) vetoes it. So does\n  returning `false` for the duplication as a whole. Bound text goes with\n  its vetoed container, and references to vetoed duplicates are cleared\n  from the remaining ones (as in `fixDuplicatedBindingsAfterDuplication`).\n  If no duplicate remains the duplication is cancelled: paste and the\n  action do nothing, alt-drag keeps moving the originals. On a partial\n  veto during alt-drag the vetoed originals are left behind.\n- On paste, resolve the target frame (and the z-order under it) before the\n  callback, so that the host sees the duplicates the way they end up in\n  the scene, and a vetoed duplicate isn't brought back.\n- Pass lookups covering just the participating elements as a third\n  argument: `duplicateElements`, `originalElements`, `origIdToDuplicateId`\n  and `duplicateIdToOrigId`.\n\nClaude Fable 5.1","timestamp":"2026-09-18T21:51:13Z","author":{"name":"dwelle","email":"5153846+dwelle@users.noreply.github.com"},"committer":{"name":"dwelle","email":"5153846+dwelle@users.noreply.github.com"}},"repository":{"id":231283452,"node_id":"MDEwOlJlcG9zaXRvcnkyMzEyODM0NTI=","name":"excalidraw","full_name":"excalidraw/excalidraw","private":false,"owner":{"login":"excalidraw","id":59452120,"node_id":"MDEyOk9yZ2FuaXphdGlvbjU5NDUyMTIw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/59452120?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/excalidraw","html_url":"https://github.com/excalidraw","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/excalidraw/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/excalidraw/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/excalidraw/gists{/gist_id}